; The steps are game-vision.md's Run structure: floors 1-5, 6-11 and 12-17, the boss on 18. Key
; combats start on floor 6 (campaign map rules: no extra Key before floor 6). Every standard pool
; holds the same M2 maps, the four Rout maps and the two Defeat the Leader maps (bandit_camp,
; watch_post): a map isn't drawn again until its pool is used up, counted across the whole run,
; so a run rarely repeats one. Both key pools hold the same four key maps, the Defeat the
; mini-boss map (hall) among them, since setup places the mini-boss on the leader slot. The boss pool
; keeps m1_greybox until the Powder Baron's map (P05 EN11).
[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Resource_standard_1"]
script = ExtResource("2_pool")
node_type = 0
first_floor = 1
last_floor = 5
maps = Array[ExtResource("3_map")]([ExtResource("5_crossroads"), ExtResource("6_river_ford"), ExtResource("7_old_mill"), ExtResource("8_ruined_chapel"), ExtResource("12_bandit_camp"), ExtResource("13_watch_post")])

